            <description><![CDATA[<h3 class="TeaserHeadline_teaserHeadline__3PUci TeaserHeadline_plus2__z0_lD ContentTeaser_title__HpqmX"><a href="https://www.dw.com/en/karen-allen-ai-powered-disinformation-what-is-at-stake-for-democracy-in-african-countries/video-72684896" class="Link_link__c7Z5r Link_withHover__xs3LF Link_withVisited__nv7aW ContentTeaser_link__KPKJZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hreflang="en"><svg class="Icon_icon__uVOdD Link_icon__bQ3NS Link_iconStart__kvfPz" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.114 7.599H13.5l.002 4.706h.601l4.582 3.25-.005-11.11zM11.084 4.444l-9.007.002-1.336.797.002 9.514 1.334.793 9.007.006 1.509-.799-.004-9.516z"></path></svg>AI-powered disinformation — effects on democracy in Africa</a></h3>
<p class="TeaserText_teaserText__W7pyA"><a href="https://www.dw.com/en/karen-allen-ai-powered-disinformation-what-is-at-stake-for-democracy-in-african-countries/video-72684896" class="Link_link__c7Z5r ContentTeaser_link__KPKJZ ContentTeaser_teaser___eEye" tabindex="-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hreflang="en">Karen Allen, Senior Research Associate at Institute for Security Studies (ISS) in South Africa and a former BBC foreign correspondent, examines how AI is being weaponized to spread disinformation across Africa. </a></p>
<h3 class="TeaserHeadline_teaserHeadline__3PUci TeaserHeadline_plus2__z0_lD ContentTeaser_title__HpqmX"><a href="https://www.dw.com/en/ai-assisted-fact-checking-in-arabic-the-kashif-chatbot/video-72675970" class="Link_link__c7Z5r Link_withHover__xs3LF Link_withVisited__nv7aW ContentTeaser_link__KPKJZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hreflang="en"><svg class="Icon_icon__uVOdD Link_icon__bQ3NS Link_iconStart__kvfPz" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.114 7.599H13.5l.002 4.706h.601l4.582 3.25-.005-11.11zM11.084 4.444l-9.007.002-1.336.797.002 9.514 1.334.793 9.007.006 1.509-.799-.004-9.516z"></path></svg>AI-assisted fact-checking in Arabic: the Kashif chatbot</a></h3>
<p class="TeaserText_teaserText__W7pyA"><a href="https://www.dw.com/en/ai-assisted-fact-checking-in-arabic-the-kashif-chatbot/video-72675970" class="Link_link__c7Z5r ContentTeaser_link__KPKJZ ContentTeaser_teaser___eEye" tabindex="-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hreflang="en">The fact-checking organisation Kashif operates out of Ramallah in the West Bank. In this video, founder Riham Abu Aita explains how the Kashif bot, an Arabic-language chatbot that supports user queries, was developed and implemented. </a></p>
<h3 class="TeaserHeadline_teaserHeadline__3PUci TeaserHeadline_plus2__z0_lD ContentTeaser_title__HpqmX"><a href="https://www.dw.com/en/christo-buschek-unraveling-the-ai-black-box-basics-of-dataset-investigation/video-72684900" class="Link_link__c7Z5r Link_withHover__xs3LF Link_withVisited__nv7aW ContentTeaser_link__KPKJZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hreflang="en"><svg class="Icon_icon__uVOdD Link_icon__bQ3NS Link_iconStart__kvfPz" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.114 7.599H13.5l.002 4.706h.601l4.582 3.25-.005-11.11zM11.084 4.444l-9.007.002-1.336.797.002 9.514 1.334.793 9.007.006 1.509-.799-.004-9.516z"></path></svg> Christo Buschek: Unraveling the AI black box</a></h3>
<p class="TeaserText_teaserText__W7pyA"><a href="https://www.dw.com/en/christo-buschek-unraveling-the-ai-black-box-basics-of-dataset-investigation/video-72684900" class="Link_link__c7Z5r ContentTeaser_link__KPKJZ ContentTeaser_teaser___eEye" tabindex="-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hreflang="en">Algorithmic systems such as AI are taking hold in our societies and daily lives. Yet, the inner workings of these systems are opaque and often kept secret.</a></p>
<h3 class="TeaserHeadline_teaserHeadline__3PUci TeaserHeadline_plus2__z0_lD ContentTeaser_title__HpqmX"><a href="https://www.dw.com/en/nikita-roy-how-conversational-ai-is-changing-journalism/video-72684890" class="Link_link__c7Z5r Link_withHover__xs3LF Link_withVisited__nv7aW ContentTeaser_link__KPKJZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hreflang="en"><svg class="Icon_icon__uVOdD Link_icon__bQ3NS Link_iconStart__kvfPz" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.114 7.599H13.5l.002 4.706h.601l4.582 3.25-.005-11.11zM11.084 4.444l-9.007.002-1.336.797.002 9.514 1.334.793 9.007.006 1.509-.799-.004-9.516z"></path></svg>Nikita Roy: How conversational AI is changing journalism</a></h3>
<p class="TeaserText_teaserText__W7pyA"><a href="https://www.dw.com/en/nikita-roy-how-conversational-ai-is-changing-journalism/video-72684890" class="Link_link__c7Z5r ContentTeaser_link__KPKJZ ContentTeaser_teaser___eEye" tabindex="-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hreflang="en">The founder of Newsroom Robots Lab at Harvard breaks down how conversational AI is revolutionizing journalism. </a></p>]]></description>
